Scenario: candidate caps=0b111, coalition union=0b011, required=0b011
(Coalition already covers all required capabilities; candidate adds only an unrequired bit ⇒ no coverage gain.)

policy                       | decision    | score
----------------------------------------------------------
ThresholdPolicy(Synergistic) | act = true  | score = 195.000000
AifDecisionPolicy (EFE)      | act = false | score =   0.000000

DIVERGENCE: Threshold says JOIN but AIF says DON'T JOIN.
  The Synergistic calculator rewards the extra member's raw size/capability/trust
  (positive marginal value => JOIN), while the AIF bridge sees no gain in
  required-capability coverage (G unchanged => margin ~ 0 => DON'T JOIN).

